# runtime/deepagents@1.0.0 (#1083 F5). The versions F0 probed (multi-framework spec §6.1): Deep
# Agents on runtime/langgraph@1.0.0's LangGraph set, plus the kit's own packages (h11 for the
# model proxy's listener, httpx for its upstream calls, psycopg for memory and knowledge,
# OpenTelemetry for traces). deepagents pulls in the Anthropic and Google GenAI LangChain
# packages and SDKs; the adapter never uses them (it passes a ChatOpenAI at the kit's proxy); kit
# deployments are meant to deny egress by default (F1b, not run on a real engine for this
# runtime). No langchain-community and no `allow_dangerous_*`
# tools (spec §13.3); LangSmith is in the lock as a langchain-core dependency, and the entry point
# removes its environment variables before import (§8.2).
